  pages:
  - pageImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageDescription: 'Welcome to the paper world!


      Lets go through the tutorial
      to learn what you can find when exploring the paper world!'
  - pageImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageDescription: 'You play as an ink inside a paper world. You can explore this
      world, but your ink is limited! And after your ink ran out, you will be sent
      to your starting location.


      Your ink trails linger across time, but
      only for a while. Any trail you leave behind will remain visible for your next
      two runs before fading away completely.'
  - pageImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageDescription: 'The ink trail you left on the ground can be used to press buttons,
      and it will remain pressed until your ink trail fade away.


      Who knows
      what''s the button do, but why not press it while you''re in the way.'
  - pageImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageDescription: "While exploring the paper world, you might pass across interesting
      things, such as items and notes! \n\nThose items will help you traverse the
      paper world. You can inteact with it by simply pressing E."
  - pageImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageDescription: Items like keys can be used to open doors. Just ran trough the
      door while having the key to open it. The door you opened with the key you
      owned will not be closed again. Neat!
